       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SUBVM-LYAPUNOV.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SUBVM-LYAPUNOV-PROOFS.
           05  WS-LYAPUNOV-ENERGY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FEYNMAN-BOUND-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ACCUMULATOR-ISO-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STABILITY-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUBVM-LYAPUNOV-SEAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SUBVM-LYAPUNOV-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-LYP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-LYP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ENERGY-AND-FEYNMAN.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ACCUMULATOR-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-LYP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ENERGY-AND-FEYNMAN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LYAPUNOV-ENERGY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FEYNMAN-BOUND-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ACCUMULATOR-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ACCUMULATOR-ISO-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STABILITY-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-LYP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-LYAPUNOV-ENERGY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FEYNMAN-BOUND-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ACCUMULATOR-ISO-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STABILITY-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SUBVM-LYAPUNOV-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-LYP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-LYP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-LYP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-LYP-CODE.
